  "intro": "<div class=\"intro\">\n    <h1><a href=\"/\">Tracy Osborn</a></h1>\n    <div class=\"subheader\">\n        <h2>travels around the world speaking at conferences and giving workshops.</h2>\n    </div>\n\n    {% include 'includes/social-links.html' %}\n\n    <div class=\"hidden-sm-down\">\n        <h2 class=\"intro-cats\">Featured speaking videos</h2>\n        <ul class=\"list-unstyled categories\">\n            <li><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=UKxIswJSlIY\">PyCon Canada</a></li>\n            <li><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=lsPrhA_m6ss\">Mozilla's View Source</a></li>\n            <li><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=F7UWtXHy7tA\">PyCaribbean 2017</a></li>\n            <li><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=8LiV759Bje0\">Write the Docs NA 2016</a></li>\n            <li><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=2Ki8e2owcGg\">Fluent Conference 2016</a></li>\n            <li><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=oNN0EjJ6o90\">ELA Conf 2015</a></li>\n        </ul>\n\n        <h2 class=\"intro-cats\">Recent podcast spots</h2>\n        <ul class=\"list-unstyled categories\">\n            <li><a href=\"https://www.betonyourself.com/podcast/episode-34-tracy-osborn\">Indiedotes</a></li>\n            <li><a href=\"http://giantrobots.fm/265\">Giant Robots</a></li>\n            <li><a href=\"https://leanpub.com/podcasts/frontmatter/tracy-osborn-30-11-17\">Front Matter</a></li>\n            <li><a href=\"https://www.indiehackers.com/podcast/029-tracy-osborn-of-hello-web-design\">Indie Hackers</a></li>\n            <li><a href=\"https://startingandsustaining.com/tracy-osborn-founder-of-wedding-lovely-e03dfabb34ea?gi=7469f53a63b5\">Starting &amp; Sustaining</a></li>\n            <li><a href=\"https://ctrlclickcast.com/episodes/funding-maintaining-startups\">CTRL+CLICK CAST</a></li>\n            <li><a href=\"http://devhell.info/post/2016-05-24/escaping-to-the-canadian-hellscape/\">/dev/hell</a></li>\n            <li><a href=\"http://www.mistakes.show/episode/170-mike-hates-teal\">Let's Make Mistakes</a></li>\n            <li><a href=\"http://softwareengineeringdaily.com/2016/02/18/design-non-designers-tracy-osborn/\">Software Engineering Daily</a></li>\n            <li><a href=\"http://www.productpeople.tv/74\">Product People</a></li>\n            <li><a href=\"https://www.podcastinit.com/episode-11-naomi-ceder-lynn-root-and-tracy-osborn-on-diversity-in-the-python-community/\">Podcast __init__</a></li>\n            <li><a href=\"http://www.chasingproduct.com/episodes/episode-24-learning-go-wtracy-osborn\">Chasing Product</a></li>\n            <li><a href=\"http://5by5.tv/bigwebshow/17\">The Big Web Show</a></li>\n            <li><a href=\"http://www.entrepreneuronfire.com/podcast/tracy-osborn-interview-of-weddinglovely-with-john-lee-dumas-of-entrepreneur-on-fire/\">Entrepreneur-on-Fire</a></li>\n            <li><a href=\"http://topknotcreative.com/talk/tracy-osborn/\">TopKnot Creative</a></li>\n        </ul>\n    </div>\n</div>",
  "content": "<figure>\n  <img src=\"/static/images/tracy-osborn.jpg\" alt=\"Tracy Osborn speaking at Fluent 2016\" />\n  <figcaption>Speaking at O'Reilly's Fluent Conference 2016.</figcaption>\n</figure>\n\n<p>I speak at and keynote conferences around the world on design, development, and entrepreneurship. Recently, I was a keynote speaker at <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=fOzJ-OIZRZw\">PyCon AU</a> in August 2018.</p>\n\n<p><strong>I'd love to speak at your event!</strong> Send me an email anytime to <a href=\"mailto:tracy@tracyosborn.com\">tracy@tracyosborn.com</a>.</p>\n\n<h2>Upcoming speaking engagements</h2>\n\n<ul class=\"list-unstyled speaking-list\">\n    <li>\n        <h3><a href=\"https://www.femtoconf.com/2020/\">FemtoConf</a></h3>\n        <p class=\"date\">May 8-10, 2020</p>\n        <p class=\"location\">Darmstadt, Germany</p>\n    </li>\n</ul>\n\n<h2>Past speaking engagements</h2>\n\n<h4 style=\"margin-bottom: -0.5em; font-size: 1.1rem; color: #999;\">2019</h4>\n<ul class=\"list-unstyled speaking-list\">\n    <li>\n        <h3><a href=\"https://tw.pycon.org/2019/en-us/\">PyCon Taiwan (Keynote)</a></h3>\n        <p class=\"date\">Sept 22, 2019</p>\n        <p class=\"location\">Taipei, Taiwan</p>\n    </li>\n    <li>\n        <h3><a href=\"http://www.wtmmontreal.com/\">Women Techmakers</a></h3>\n        <p class=\"date\">March 23, 2019</p>\n        <p class=\"location\">Montreal, Quebec</p>\n    </li>\n</ul>\n\n<h4 style=\"margin-top: 2em; font-size: 1.1rem; color: #999;\">2018</h4>\n<ul class=\"list-unstyled speaking-list old-speaking-list\">\n    <li>\n        <h3><a href=\"https://www.eeconf.com/\">EE Conf</a></h3>\n        <p class=\"date\">Oct 24-26, 2018</p>\n        <p class=\"location\">Nashville, TN</p>\n    </li>\n    <li>\n        <h3><a href=\"https://2018.pycon-au.org/\">PyCon AU</a></h3>\n        <p class=\"date\">August 25-26, 2018</p>\n        <p class=\"location\">Sydney, Australia</p>\n    </li>\n    <li>\n        <h3><a href=\"https://2018.djangocon.com.au/\">DjangoCon AU</a></h3>\n        <p class=\"date\">August 24, 2018</p>\n        <p class=\"location\">Sydney, Australia</p>\n    </li>\n    <li>\n        <h3><a href=\"https://addconf.com/2018/\">ADDC</a></h3>\n        <p class=\"date\">July 5-6, 2018</p>\n        <p class=\"location\">Barcelona, Spain</p>\n    </li>\n    <li>\n        <h3><a href=\"https://beyondtellerrand.com/events/duesseldorf-2018/speakers/tracy-osborn\">Beyond Tellerand</a></h3>\n        <p class=\"date\">May 7-9, 2018</p>\n        <p class=\"location\">Dusseldorf, Germany</p>\n    </li>\n      <li>\n        <h3><a href=\"https://www.meetup.com/lean-product/\">Lean Product</a></h3>\n        <p class=\"date\">April 19, 2018</p>\n        <p class=\"location\">Mountain View, CA</p>\n    </li>\n    <li>\n      <h3><a href=\"https://www.elastic.co/elasticon/conf/2018/sf\">Elastic{ON}</a></h3>\n        <p class=\"date\">February 28, 2018</p>\n        <p class=\"location\">San Francisco, CA</p>\n    </li>\n</ul>\n\n<h4 style=\"margin-top: 2em; font-size: 1.1rem; color: #999;\">2017</h4>\n<ul class=\"list-unstyled speaking-list old-speaking-list\">\n    <li>\n        <h3><a href=\"https://www.codeeurope.pl/en/speakers/tracy-osborn\">Code Europe</a></h3>\n        <p class=\"date\">December 5-7, 2017</p>\n        <p class=\"location\">Krakow and Warsaw, Poland</p>\n    </li>\n    <li>\n        <h3><a href=\"http://pyconie17.python.ie/\">PyCon Ireland</a></h3>\n        <p class=\"date\">October 21-22, 2017</p>\n        <p class=\"location\">Dublin, Ireland</p>\n    </li>\n    <li>\n        <h3><a href=\"https://2017.releasenotes.tv/\">Release Notes</a></h3>\n        <p class=\"date\">October 16-18, 2017</p>\n        <p class=\"location\">Chicago, Illinois</p>\n    </li>\n    <li>\n        <h3><a href=\"http://pyss17.pyss.org/\">Python San Sebastian</a></h3>\n        <p class=\"date\">October 6-8, 2017</p>\n        <p class=\"location\">San Sebastian, Spain</p>\n    </l