isingstack.com\">NodeConf Budapest</a></h3>\n        <p class=\"date\">January 20, 2017</p>\n        <p class=\"location\">Budapest, Hungary</p>\n    </li>\n    <li>\n        <h3><a href=\"http://2017.cusec.net/\">CUSEC 17</a></h3>\n        <p class=\"date\">January 12-14, 2017</p>\n        <p class=\"location\">Montreal, Canada</p>\n    </li>\n</ul>\n\n<h4 style=\"margin-top: 2em; font-size: 1.1rem; color: #999;\">2016</h4>\n<ul class=\"list-unstyled speaking-list old-speaking-list\">\n    <li>\n        <h3><a href=\"https://2016.nodeconf.com.ar\">NodeConf Argentina</a></h3>\n        <p class=\"date\">November 17-19, 2016</p>\n        <p class=\"location\">Buenos Aires, Argentina</p>\n    </li>\n    <li>\n        <h3><a href=\"https://2016.pycon.ca/en/\">PyCon Canada</a></h3>\n        <p class=\"date\">November 12-13, 2016</p>\n        <p class=\"location\">Toronto, Canada</p>\n    </li>\n    <li>\n        <h3><a href=\"https://allthingsopen.org/speakers/tracy-osborn/\">All Things Open</a></h3>\n        <p class=\"date\">October 26-27, 2016</p>\n        <p class=\"location\">Raleigh, NC</p>\n    </li>\n    <li>\n        <h3><a href=\"http://conferences.oreilly.com/oscon/open-source-eu\">OSCON London</a></h3>\n        <p class=\"date\">October 17-20, 2016</p>\n        <p class=\"location\">London, England</p>\n    </li>\n    <li>\n        <h3><a href=\"https://viewsourceconf.org/berlin-2016/\">View Source Conference</a></h3>\n        <p class=\"date\">September 12-14, 2016</p>\n        <p class=\"location\">Berlin, Germany</p>\n    </li>\n    <li>\n        <h3><a href=\"http://www.devopsdays.org/events/2016-boston/program/tracy-osborn/\">DevOpsDay Boston</a></h3>\n        <p class=\"date\">August 25-26, 2016</p>\n        <p class=\"location\">Boston, MA</p>\n    </li>\n    <li>\n        <h3><a href=\"http://abstractions.io/schedule/#session-full-105\">Abstractions</a></h3>\n        <p class=\"date\">August 18-20, 2016</p>\n        <p class=\"location\">Pittsburgh, PA</p>\n    </li>\n    <li>\n        <h3><a href=\"https://2016.djangocon.us/schedule/presentation/8/\">DjangoCon US</a></h3>\n        <p class=\"date\">July 26-27, 2016</p>\n        <p class=\"location\">Philadelphia, PA</p>\n    </li>\n    <li>\n        <h3><a href=\"https://2016.pygotham.org/talks/242/design-for-non-designers/\">PyGotham</a></h3>\n        <p class=\"date\">July 18-19, 2016</p>\n        <p class=\"location\">New York City, NY</p>\n    </li>\n    <li>\n        <h3><a href=\"http://codeconf.com/speakers/tracy-osborn.html\">GitHub CodeConf</a></h3>\n        <p class=\"date\">June 26-27, 2016</p>\n        <p class=\"location\">Los Angeles, CA</p>\n    </li>\n    <li>\n        <h3><a href=\"https://us.pycon.org/2016/speaker/profile/386/\">PyCon 2016</a></h3>\n        <p class=\"date\">May 28-June 5, 2016</p>\n        <p class=\"location\">Portland, OR</p>\n    </li>\n    <li>\n        <h3><a href=\"http://www.writethedocs.org/conf/na/2016/speakers/\">Write the Docs North America</a></h3>\n        <p class=\"date\">May 22-24, 2016</p>\n        <p class=\"location\">Portland, OR</p>\n    </li>\n    <li>\n        <h3><a href=\"http://selfconference.org/events/2/schedule\">Self.conference 2016</a></h3>\n        <p class=\"date\">May 20-21, 2016</p>\n        <p class=\"location\">Detroit, MI</p>\n    </li>\n    <li>\n        <h3><a href=\"http://webdevcon.com/\">WebDevCon 2016</a></h3>\n        <p class=\"date\">April 21, 2016</p>\n        <p class=\"location\">Seattle, WA</p>\n    </li>\n    <li>\n        <h3><a href=\"http://www.microconf.com/growth/past-videos/\">MicroConf 2016</a></h3>\n        <p class=\"date\">April 3-6, 2016</p>\n        <p class=\"location\">Las Vegas, NV</p>\n    </li>\n    <li>\n        <h3><a href=\"https://conferences.oreilly.com/fluent/fl-ca-2016/public/schedule/speaker/215734\">O'Reilly Fluent Conference 2016</a></h3>\n        <p class=\"date\">March 7-10, 2016</p>\n        <p class=\"location\">San Francisco, CA</p>\n    </li>